{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CEREBRUM Remastered - Awaken Alone. Fight Your Friends. Save Them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong><br>Greyne awakens from a long slumber to find a world plunged into nightmare. The vile RESERVE and his mysterious accomplice have trapped every inhabitant in an eternal bad dream. Greyne's friends are no longer themselves; their fears and pain have twisted them into terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But within this despair lies a spark of hope: Greyne discovers that by defeating these monsters, he can free the captured souls. Each conquered boss transforms back and joins him as a playable character with unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, unite the strength of the rescued, and venture deeper into the heart of the nightmare to stop RESERVE and his sinister ally once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Nightmare You Must Escape From:</strong> Face the monstrous versions of your friends in boss battles that will leave you restless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Your Allies:</strong> Unlock each defeated boss as a playable character, rousing them from their nightmare sleep to utilize their unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>United We Stand, Asleep We Fall:</strong> Combine your team's powers to explore new dreamlike realms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake Your Brain!:</strong> Master challenging 2D puzzle-platformers that require wit and skill, promising hopefully not too many sleepless nights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatter the Nightmare. Fight your friends to save them. Defy RESERVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pest Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002710/3fbd4679ceb6a363f0cc74d611f12187d9338e8e.jpg"},{"name":"U I I A U","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002710/2821016061c4c579227fe0c28f68e5cf94473fb1.jpg"},{"name":"Turn the lights on","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002710/26bf44856442f20943a175746c4ddfa2b153336b.jpg"},{"name":"I M P O S S I B L E","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002710/52cb46c854879c2a5a33c0dcd074e29d053cb749.jpg"},{"name":"Never trust a snake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002710/eea7f57ad72f6e2487dd2e0dc248976db6ae82ff.jpg"},{"name":"Yap Yap Yap...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002710/c8fa73cd317cb36ebf57cff0d3436f015c875ad7.jpg"},{"name":"Mouse Code","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002710/4a1824f69520f37a17acc853e0d7694b2be0101d.jpg"},{"name":"Flappy.ZIP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002710/cbd78082bb5099ea4e2f390b9a7217fc5d93108d.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002710?t=1766404383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002710/cfe7ca289a051c18f73064f4610c5e867b8784af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766404383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002710/18ab04775f64752e43913e65dc6249f059d548ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766404383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002710/18ab04775f64752e43913e65dc6249f059d548ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766404383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CEREBRUM Remastered - Awaken Alone. Fight Your Friends. Save Them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong><br>Greyne awakens from a long slumber to find a world plunged into nightmare. The vile RESERVE and his mysterious accomplice have trapped every inhabitant in an eternal bad dream. Greyne's friends are no longer themselves; their fears and pain have twisted them into terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But within this despair lies a spark of hope: Greyne discovers that by defeating these monsters, he can free the captured souls. Each conquered boss transforms back and joins him as a playable character with unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, unite the strength of the rescued, and venture deeper into the heart of the nightmare to stop RESERVE and his sinister ally once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Nightmare You Must Escape From:</strong> Face the monstrous versions of your friends in boss battles that will leave you restless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Your Allies:</strong> Unlock each defeated boss as a playable character, rousing them from their nightmare sleep to utilize their unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>United We Stand, Asleep We Fall:</strong> Combine your team's powers to explore new dreamlike realms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake Your Brain!:</strong> Master challenging 2D puzzle-platformers that require wit and skill, promising hopefully not too many sleepless nights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatter the Nightmare. Fight your friends to save them. Defy RESERVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Jannikde